{"id":"d_main_41_04","cat":"main","group":{"id":"ch41","label":"Chapter 41 · Birth"},"label":"The Meaning of Coexistence","stage":"41-17 STAGE · Start","prev":"d_main_41_03","next":"d_main_41_05","speakers":{"liberalio":"Liberalio","bahamut":"Bahamut"},"icons":{"liberalio":"si_c262_00_s","bahamut":"si_c563_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"d_main_41_04_1","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_1","text":"Liberalio lands on the ground.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"WhiteArk_2","bgArt":"whiteark_2","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_quietterror","movie":null,"shown":["liberalio"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_2","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_2","text":"Strangely, she seems exhausted.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_3","text":"A signal flare. It seems your comrades made it down safely.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_4","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_4","text":"Yeah. All we have to do is head that way...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_5","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_5","text":"I take a step back.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_6","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_6","text":"By the way... what's your goal?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_7","text":"??","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_8","text":"Didn't we form an alliance?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_9","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_9","text":"Because of your meddling, the Four Beasts...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_10","text":"You're wrong, Human.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_11","text":"A Queen must never be created. Haven't I already explained this?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_12","text":"I'll say this once more: don't stake the world on your personal feelings. You're just one human.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_13","text":"Whether or not the Four Beasts can create a Queen doesn't matter. Preventing it from happening is what's crucial.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_14","text":"Besides, the Four Beasts are already dead set against you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_15","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_15","text":"That's because of you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_16","text":"Is it? I don't know the details, but think about what has happened until now.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_17","text":"You kept trying to persuade them, but did it work, even for a moment?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_18","text":"Don't you think negotiating with them was a hopeless endeavor from the start?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_19","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_19","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_20","text":"I'm weakened now, and though the Four Beasts may be half-wits, they are four Heretics afterall.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_21","text":"Besides, two of them are already capable of transformation.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_22","text":"All of you need to cooperate with me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_23","text":"We need to destroy the Queen they're trying to make and eliminate the Four Beasts to prevent any future disaster.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_24","text":"I would like to remind you that all of this aligns with your own interests.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_25","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_25","text":"... We need to keep an eye on the situation.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_26","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_26","text":"We won't try to kill you immediately, so keep that in mind.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_27","text":"Can I take that as you agreeing to work together?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_28","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_28","text":"Consider it a temporary alliance.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_29","text":"You're not someone who will easily let things go, are you?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_30","text":"... Perhaps that's how you've made it this far in life.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"bahamut","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_31","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"DarkMatterFilter","bgArt":"darkmatterfilter","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_confront","movie":null,"shown":["bahamut"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"bahamut","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_32","text":"I, and all my intellectual grandeur, am deep in rumination.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"bahamut","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_33","text":"Should I pursue the Young Man, or remain here and guard this place?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"bahamut","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_34","text":"I did not expect one of the Offsprings to interfere.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"bahamut","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_35","text":"She is strong.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"bahamut","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_36","text":"... Or was she?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"bahamut","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_37","text":"No. She wasn't. She was merely strong enough to trade blows.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"bahamut","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_38","text":"With all my infinite intelligence, I can only come to one conclusion:","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"bahamut","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_39","text":"Since I've become the ever-mighty Bahamut,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"bahamut","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_40","text":"it is possible for me to pursue the Offspring, strike her down, and capture the Young Man.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"bahamut","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_41","text":"But Levi also said to guard the Furnace at all costs.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"bahamut","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_42","text":"Creating the Queen is something we have long desired to accomplish.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"bahamut","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_43","text":"Yet, it remains evident that both chasing down the Young Man and guarding the Furnace cannot be done simultaneously.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"bahamut","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_44","text":"I, in my abundant wisdom, must make a decision this very instant.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"bahamut","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_45","text":"Hmm...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"bahamut","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_46","text":"Ah...\nAaaah...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"bahamut","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_47","text":"As I hesitate, the Offspring has vanished from sight.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"bahamut","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_48","text":"That removes one option.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"bahamut","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_49","text":"Therefore, what I must do has become clear.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"bahamut","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_50","text":"I must guard the Furnace.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"bahamut","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_51","text":"Very well. With this, my path is set.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_52","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_52","text":"Bahamut gazes at the Furnace.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_53","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_53","text":"The Dark Matter boils ever more furiously.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_54","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_54","text":"She then notices something strange.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_55","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_55","text":"From some Dark Matter that has spilled and pooled below the Furnace...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_56","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_56","text":"Something slowly begins to rise.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"bahamut","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_57","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"bahamut","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_58","text":"Oh... Ohhh...!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"bahamut","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_59","text":"Is this perhaps...!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_60","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_60","text":"You don't look so good.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"WhiteArk_1","bgArt":"whiteark_1","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_quietterror","movie":null,"shown":["liberalio"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_61","text":"I don't feel too good either.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_62","text":"I didn't get a chance to recover.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_63","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_63","text":"Where have you been and what have you been up to?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_64","text":"That, I cannot tell you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_65","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_65","text":"I thought you said we were allies.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_66","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_66","text":"You must have your own secrets that you don't want to share?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_67","text":"There is no need to tell you everything just because we're allies.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_68","text":"Only the information that is necessary for the current situation should be shared, so there won't be any complications later.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_69","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_69","text":"... The Four Beasts have begun creating their Queen.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_70","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_70","text":"I'm aware. I saw it myself.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_71","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_71","text":"I don't know what will come out of it, but it won't be a Queen.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_72","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_72","text":"A Queen can't possibly be created using such methods.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_73","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_73","text":"But I'm certain it will turn out to be something akin to a Heretic, or even worse.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_74","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_74","text":"That reason alone makes our alliance all the more important.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_75","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_75","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_76","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_76","text":"Liberalio.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_77","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_77","text":"Is there a Queen on the surface right now?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_78","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_78","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_79","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_79","text":"There must be a reason why you are asking that out of the blue.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_80","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_80","text":"A gene inside me that bonds with the Queen has awakened.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_81","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_81","text":"I thought that it was a bond to the Four Beasts' Queen, but they haven't made one yet.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_82","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_82","text":"... But this is something I cannot reveal.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_83","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_83","text":"You said so yourself that you were cleaning things up.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_84","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_84","text":"That way \"someone\" would be happy.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_85","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_85","text":"There's only one person you revere so highly...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_86","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_86","text":"That's right. The original Queen.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_87","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_87","text":"My mother.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_88","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_88","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_89","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_89","text":"Mother isn't on the surface right now.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_90","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_90","text":"But she will come soon. It's been decided.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_91","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_91","text":"I am merely preparing for that inevitable day.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_92","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_92","text":"When Mother comes, nothing but her children should remain on the surface.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_93","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_93","text":"That's what I'm working towards.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_94","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_94","text":"And if the Queen does come down, do you really expect us to do nothing?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_95","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_95","text":"It would not be wise decision.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_96","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_96","text":"You cannot win.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_97","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_97","text":"Besides, I've mentioned this before. \nRaptures right now have no interest in humans.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_98","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_98","text":"The will of the Raptures is Mother's will.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_99","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_99","text":"If you provoke her needlessly, she might change her mind.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_100","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_100","text":"Isn't there a saying, don't poke the bear?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_101","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_101","text":"It'd probably be best if all of you lived out your remaining days underground.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_102","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_102","text":"Consider it a form of coexistence.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_103","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_103","text":"There's no way you can call that coexistence.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_104","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_104","text":"Don't mistake coexistence as living together as equals, Human.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_105","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_105","text":"When you humans ruled the surface, did you not coexist with the worms that lived underground?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_106","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_106","text":"It's the same principle here.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_107","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_107","text":"We can use you humans as needed, but we won't drive you to extinction.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_108","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_108","text":"Every species has its role.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_109","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_109","text":"Fulfilling that role without annihilating the other...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_110","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_110","text":"That's the very definition of coexistence.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_111","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_111","text":"We're not your playthings to be used at your convenience.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_112","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_112","text":"Then let me ask you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_113","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_113","text":"On the surface, and in this world...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_114","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_114","text":"What is humanity's role?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_115","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_115","text":"Why don't you tell me what your beloved Queen's role is first?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_116","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_116","text":"Just as worms cannot question your role as humans, nor understand your intentions...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_117","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_117","text":"Neither can you fathom mother's role, nor her intent.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_118","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_118","text":"Sounds like something you'd say when you don't have a real answer.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_119","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_119","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_120","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_120","text":"You don't know either, do you? \nWhat the role of the Queen is. What the role of Raptures are.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_121","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_121","text":"You're right. I don't.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_122","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_122","text":"But I don't need to know.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_123","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_123","text":"There is no way that Mother's judgment is wrong.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_124","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_124","text":"Liberalio stops walking.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_125","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_125","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_126","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_126","text":"Let's rest for a bit.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_127","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_127","text":"You're in really bad shape.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_128","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_128","text":"Yes. It's impossible to unleash my true strength right now.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_129","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_129","text":"Why don't you soak yourself in that Dark Matter bath?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_130","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_130","text":"You're a Heretic, so it should work on you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_131","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_131","text":"It would be very effective indeed.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_132","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_132","text":"But I can't go right now, since Bahamut is there.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_133","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_133","text":"What is Dark Matter exactly?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_134","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_134","text":"Mother's blood.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_135","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_135","text":"The substance that makes her.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_136","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_136","text":"It's composed of nanomachines, and its form has no limit.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_137","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_137","text":"To put it bluntly, it could be considered an all-purpose material. Since it can become anything.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_138","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_138","text":"I thought you said the Queen wasn't on the surface. What's her blood doing here then?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_139","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_139","text":"In the past, a single drop of her blood fell down to the surface.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_140","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_140","text":"The Profound multiplied it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_141","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_141","text":"Arrogant, foolish things.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_142","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_142","text":"They failed to comprehend Mother's blood and left it unattended.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_143","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_143","text":"But its reproductive instinct remained, and it continues to multiply to this day.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_144","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_41_04_144","text":"So with time...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_41_04_145","type":"Speech","s